### Requisições de teste — use com a extensão "REST Client" do VS Code
### Clique em "Send Request" acima de cada requisição.
### Ordem sugerida: cadastrar → login → usar o resto (o token é preenchido sozinho).

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}


############################## AUTENTICAÇÃO ##############################

### Cadastrar usuário (o PRIMEIRO cadastrado vira admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Seu Nome",
  "email": "voce@email.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Login (guarda o token para as próximas requisições)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "voce@email.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Meus dados
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


############################## PRODUTOS ##############################

### Listar produtos (não precisa de login)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products

### Ver um produto
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/1

### Criar produto (só admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Boné",
  "price": 39.9,
  "stock": 15
}

### Editar produto (só admin) — envie só os campos que quer mudar
PUT {{baseUrl}}/products/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 49.9
}

### Excluir produto (só admin)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/products/4
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


############################## CARRINHO ##############################

### Ver meu carrinho
GET {{baseUrl}}/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Adicionar item ao carrinho
POST {{baseUrl}}/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 1,
  "quantity": 2
}

### Remover item do carrinho
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/cart/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


############################## PEDIDOS ##############################

### Finalizar compra (transforma o carrinho em pedido)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar meus pedidos (admin vê todos)
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ver um pedido
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
